"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4324010","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3983900-1838407329257193","game_id":"steam-3983900","kind":"announcement","title":"Release date!","summary":"It's been a (relatively) long road.Badass Brigade is the first game I've ever made. The only relevant experience I had going in was modding for Starcraft 2. IYKYK. That doesn't teach you how to code but it does reveal many fundamentals like how variables work, how graphics, code, and audio all hook up to each other, etc. So going in I didn't know how to code, draw, animate, or make sounds.I was driven by Starcraft 2's editor sucking. Not to say it actually sucks, but my project files were gettin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T16:22:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329257193","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3983900-1834602721200484","game_id":"steam-3983900","kind":"update","title":"Update 1.5","summary":"Lots of behind the scenes work has been done, most of which is not in the demo (sorry), but that doesn't mean nothing has changed.Unlockable weapons found in missions 1 and 2 have been largely changed. These weapons were created early in development and aren't as interesting as some of the later ones. I figured the beginning of the game could use some more excitement. The removed weapons will be available elsewhere eventually. Added a few that are on the critical path so you can still get new on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T00:47:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200484","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3983900-1822556746155748","game_id":"steam-3983900","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release on the 30th!","summary":"The demo is almost here! Thank you to everyone who participated in the playtest!Content available in the demo is the tutorial + first two missions. That's around 2-3 hours of game (or 1 if you're me). Please leave your feedback wherever you like or write a review with what you love, like, or hate. Join the discord!: https://discord.gg/bGSEj6UC5g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-21T01:37:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746155748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3983900-1814309641429012","game_id":"steam-3983900","kind":"announcement","title":"It's playtest time!","summary":"Hello friends!Badass Brigade is officially open for playtesting. The actual game content available is the beginning of the game without any alterations. Here's exactly what that means:Tutorial + first 3 missions. A mission should take around 1 hour+ to complete at my best estimate. For context, personally it takes me 30 minutes to clear a mission while getting every secret and knowing exactly where to go and what to do while absolutely crushing every enemy encounter.1 Training side mission. Curr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-23T02:38:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641429012","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3983900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3983900":"2026-10-26T11:21:34Z"},"noti